---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { url } from '../consts';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="About Small Space Style — a small-space home decor blog for renters and apartment living, written from India for US readers."
>
  <section class="page">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h1>About</h1>
      <p>
        <strong>Small Space Style</strong> is a home decor blog for
        people in small apartments and rented homes. It is written by Parth,
        a developer based in India, for readers in the United States, the
        United Kingdom and Australia.
      </p>
      <p>
        The idea is simple: a small room can feel finished without buying
        furniture that doesn't fit, drilling holes in a wall you don't own,
        or spending a fortune. Every guide on this site is a buying guide,
        not an inspiration gallery — it gives real measurements in inches
        and feet, prices in dollars, and an honest answer to who a product
        is <em>not</em> for.
      </p>
      <p>
        There are no photos of my home here and no face on camera. The work
        is the research: comparing sizes, materials and prices, and writing
        it up clearly so you can decide in minutes, not hours.
      </p>
      <h2>How the site earns money</h2>
      <p>
        Some links on this site are affiliate links. If you buy through
        them, I may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. That never
        changes what I recommend. Read the full
        <a href={url('/disclosure/')}> affiliate disclosure</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
